## Unit testing 

The project includes unit testing for all three ETL stages.

The test includes: 
* Checking extracted data is not empty and contains expected columns

* Verifying transformations (rename columns, correct data types and handling missing values)

* Mocked database tests for loading data (both happy and unhappy)

Before you can run the test you will need to make sure pytest is installed.
In your terminal run the following code - 
pip install pytest 

To run the test in the terminal type the following code:
pytest test_flight_delays.py 

Once run you should see all test as pass
