## Challenges I faced 

The challenges I faced whilst completing this prject were: 

* Setting up mocked database connections for testing required careful handling of the cursor and commit opperations

* Ensuring transformed data matched PostgreSQL's strict data types led to multiple iterations and validation checks

* Writing unhappy path tests encouraged me to think critically about how the pipeline should behanve in failure sceanarios, which improved the overall quality of the project. 